Description: Unified COSMIC Desktop Environment (Epoch Monorepo)
 This package provides the full stack of the System76 COSMIC Desktop 
 Environment, including the panel, settings, and core libraries, built
 from the cosmic-epoch monorepo. The compositor is in cosmic-epoch-comp.
